body:
I just re-added some cases to option and optgroup parsing to continue supporting auto-closing tags outside of a select tag to support cases like this, which I found in a test case [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/web_tests/fast/forms/select/option-defaultselected.html;l=25;drc=77578ccb4082ae20a9326d9e673225f1189ebb63):
```javascript
const select = document.createElement('select');
select.innerHTML = '<option>one<option>two';
```
